-- 25 new venues (16 bars, 9 cafés), 2026-11-06. See design/venue-review-2026-11.csv.
--
-- All go in as pin_status 'pending' with NO coordinates: the CLAUDE.md rule
-- is that a pin is placed only from Kar-confirmed lat/lng, never a guess.
-- Pending venues are not public (functions/api/venues.js), so nothing shows
-- in the app until each pin is set — with the review sheet + the UPDATE
-- file that follows it, or Kar's "Pending venues" admin screen.
-- verified = 0 throughout. hours are filled only where a source states them
-- (named in `source`); everywhere else NULL = "hours unconfirmed".
-- No photos: only the venue's own or permitted photos (CLAUDE.md).
--
-- Run once, from the repo root:
--   npx wrangler d1 execute muan-db --remote --file=scripts/add-venues-2026-11.sql
-- INSERT OR IGNORE, so running it twice changes nothing.

